      summary: Recall Memory Points
      description: >-
        Search k memories similar to given text with specified metadata
        criteria.
            
        Example

        ----------

        ```

        collection = "episodic"

        content = "MIAO!"

        metadata = {"custom_key": "custom_value"}

        req_json = {
            "content": content,
            "metadata": metadata,
        }

        # create a point

        res = requests.post(
            f"http://localhost:1865/memory/collections/{collection}/points", json=req_json
        )


        # recall with metadata

        req_json = {
            "text": "CAT", 
            "metadata":{"custom_key":"custom_value"}
        }

        res = requests.post(
            f"http://localhost:1865/memory/recall", json=req_json
        )

        json = res.json()

        print(json)

        ```
      operationId: recall_memory_points
